        "content": "// Generado desde bloques\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(3, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(5, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(6, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  analogWrite(3, random(0, 256));\n  analogWrite(5, random(0, 256));\n  analogWrite(6, random(0, 256));\n  delay(500);\n}\n"
